@RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7200

### Register employee
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee2@example.com",
  "password": "Employee123"
}

### Login
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "Employee123"
}

### Login employee
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee@example.com",
  "password": "Employee123"
}

### Login manager
# @name loginManager
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "Manager123"
}

### Login finance
# @name loginFinance
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "finance@example.com",
  "password": "Finance123"
}

### Create request assigned to Manager
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Office equipment",
  "amount": 800000,
  "description": "New monitor for development team",
  "urgency": "زیاد"
}

### Create request assigned to Finance
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Server purchase",
  "amount": 1500000,
  "description": "New server for infrastructure",
  "urgency": "متوسط",
  "department": "IT"
}

### Create request at exact manager threshold
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Boundary test",
  "amount": 1000000,
  "urgency": "کم"
}

### Manager must not create request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized request",
  "amount": 500000
}

### Anonymous user must not create request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Anonymous request",
  "amount": 500000
}

### Employee creates manager request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Manager approval request",
  "amount": 800000,
  "urgency": "زیاد"
}

### Employee creates finance request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finance approval request",
  "amount": 1500000,
  "urgency": "متوسط"
}

### Employee request list
GET {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Manager request list
GET {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Finance request list
GET {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFinance.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Anonymous must not list requests
GET {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests

@managerRequestId = 47aacbf9-005f-4939-a81c-38b102b72eff

### Manager approves manager request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/47aacbf9-005f-4939-a81c-38b102b72eff/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cannot reject already approved request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/47aacbf9-005f-4939-a81c-38b102b72eff/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Manager cannot approve Finance request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/eed442ec-22ea-42d2-adc1-963d91da52e9/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Finance approves finance request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/eed442ec-22ea-42d2-adc1-963d91da52e9/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFinance.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Employee cannot approve request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/47aacbf9-005f-4939-a81c-38b102b72eff/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginEmployee.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Anonymous cannot approve request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/47aacbf9-005f-4939-a81c-38b102b72eff/approve

### Missing request
POST {{RequestWorkflow.Api_HostAddress}}/api/requests/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{loginManager.response.body.$.accessToken}}